{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"display"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method presents a comprehensive debug interface that allows developers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"to inspect and monitor various aspects of the Airship SDK in real-time.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"The interface includes navigation to different debug sections and provides","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"detailed information about push notifications, analytics events, channel"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"data, and other SDK components."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The debug interface will be displayed as a modal overlay window that can","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be dismissed by the user. If a debug interface is already displayed,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"calling this method will replace the current interface."}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method must be called from the main thread."}]}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Important","style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The debug interface requires an active scene to display properly."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If no active scene is available, an error will be logged and the interface"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will not be displayed."}]}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/airshipdebug\/airshipdebugmanager\/display()"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.urbanairship.AirshipDebug\/documentation\/AirshipDebug\/AirshipDebugManager\/display()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.urbanairship.AirshipDebug\/documentation\/AirshipDebug","doc:\/\/com.urbanairship.AirshipDebug\/documentation\/AirshipDebug\/AirshipDebugManager"]]},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"title":"display()","roleHeading":"Instance Method","required":true,"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"display"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"modules":[{"name":"AirshipDebug"}],"externalID":"s:12AirshipDebug0aB7ManagerP7displayyyF","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Displays the Airship debug interface as an overlay window.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://com.urbanairship.AirshipDebug/documentation/AirshipDebug":{"url":"\/documentation\/airshipdebug","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.urbanairship.AirshipDebug\/documentation\/AirshipDebug","role":"collection","title":"AirshipDebug","type":"topic","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.urbanairship.AirshipDebug/documentation/AirshipDebug/AirshipDebugManager/display()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.urbanairship.AirshipDebug\/documentation\/AirshipDebug\/AirshipDebugManager\/display()","title":"display()","required":true,"url":"\/documentation\/airshipdebug\/airshipdebugmanager\/display()","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Displays the Airship debug interface as an overlay window."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"display","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}]},"doc://com.urbanairship.AirshipDebug/documentation/AirshipDebug/AirshipDebugManager":{"type":"topic